                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "The six-page layout remains accepted. Mode changes check recorded lengths; playing loops switch only after Stop loops and switch. Defaults and nullable track overrides remain separate. Multi uses the shared length without erasing independent overrides. Recording locks changes."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.35",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.35",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Length and mode changes use one complete engine request. Only callback-confirmed settings are displayed as active, saved or recalled. Refusals explain that the current value remains active; an unapplied bar count remains editable so the player can choose a shorter value. Auto, Back and scope changes discard that candidate."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.35",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.35",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Numeric controls support touch plus\/minus, focus, Enter to edit\/commit and Back to cancel. Physical UART encoder routing remains a later implementation task. Stage closes the originating tray. The coarse duplicate timing control has been removed."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
            "fontSize": "28",
            "fontWeight": "400",
            "type": "paragraph",
            "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
            "textDecoration": "none",
            "letterSpacing": "0",
            "fills": [
              {
                "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                "fillOpacity": 1
              }
            ],
            "fontFamily": "Arimo"
          },
          {
            "lineHeight": "1.35",
            "fontStyle": "normal",
            "children": [
              {
                "lineHeight": "1.35",
                "fontStyle": "normal",
                "textTransform": "none",
                "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
                "fontSize": "28",
                "fontWeight": "400",
                "fontVariantId": "normal-400",
                "textDecoration": "none",
                "letterSpacing": "0",
                "fills": [
                  {
                    "fillColor": "#a3adbd",
                    "fillOpacity": 1
                  }
                ],
                "fontFamily": "Arimo",
                "text": "Audio & tempo is an explicitly disabled readout until the M4\/M6 native capability is implemented. This note describes implementation status, not appliance verification. Click output and level remain under Audio until the routing\/Mixer slice replaces that path."
              }
            ],
            "textTransform": "none",
            "textAlign": "left",
            "fontId": "custom-99a2c890-1804-450c-8af8-6b60ee9a6b27",
